##############################################################################
#  P25Reflector block list
#
#  Copy to BlockList.txt (see [Block List] in P25Reflector.ini). Re-read every
#  Time minutes, no restart needed. Compatible with an xlxd.blacklist.
#
#  One entry per line, first word only. '#' comments and blank lines ignored.
#  Blocks users and the nodes they link through.
#
#  N0CALL      the station: N0CALL, N0CALL-ND, N0CALL-RPT, N0CALL/P, DL/N0CALL
#              (not N0CALLX)
#  N0CALL-ND   just that callsign
#  N0*         every callsign starting N0
#  *           everyone
#  1234567     a DMR Id
#  235*        every Id starting 235, wildcards match Ids too
#
#  Callsigns block every Id registered to them in the Id lookup file.
#
#  Remove the leading '#' to use an example.
##############################################################################

#N0CALL
#N0CALL-ND
#N0*
#1234567
#235*
